    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45993" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχῠρ-ότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strength</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν οἰκοδομίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.116
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				120
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.478
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχ</span>- Pap.), <i><span class="en">
				688
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.11.4
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχυρότης</span> is a
			v.l. and shd. be preferred in <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.57.6
			</span></i>, but for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ ὀχ</span>- (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ ἰσχ</span>
			-) in <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.644
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ ἐχ</span>- shd. be restored.)</div>
